-- Memphis reaches five active rows with the Jewish Community Center classes.
UPDATE City SET published = 1, intro = 'Memphis has a church-hosted weekly game, classes at the Jewish Community Center and several teachers. Emmanuel United Methodist Church hosts weekly National Mah Jongg League (NMJL) play, and the Memphis JCC offers adult Mah Jongg classes that non-members can join. Vicki Campbell of MahJ Memphis and Pat Ford of MahJ Squad 901 teach American Mah Jongg and run tournaments and social events around the city. If you are new, the church game welcomes beginners and the JCC runs a beginning class.', updatedAt = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE slug = 'memphis';
